memorymap
title: Firmware partition table
meta: 8MiB NOR — bootloader, two OTA slots, NVS, factory cal, scratch
cols: 16
0x000000-0x00FFFF: MCUBoot @fixed role=boot
0x010000-0x01FFFF: MCUBoot scratch @muted role=scratch
0x020000-0x41FFFF: Slot0 primary 4MiB @accent role=slot0
0x420000-0x81FFFF: Slot1 secondary 4MiB @data role=slot1
0x820000-0x83FFFF: LittleFS @note role=fs
0x840000-0x84FFFF: NVS settings @warn role=nvs
0x850000-0x85FFFF: Factory cal @error role=cal
0x860000-0xFFFFFF: Reserved @muted role=rsvd
